msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Daardie GPU-nodus of GPU bestaan nie, of is op 'n toestel waartoe jy nie toegang het nie."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "Die GPU-datanavraag kon nie by die toestel gevoeg word nie. Kontroleer dat die inprop se sjablone geïnstalleer is."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Toestel: die nodus se toestel is geskrap, dus kan die nodus slegs gedeaktiveer word."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Toestel: kies 'n bestaande Cacti-toestel."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Toestel: hierdie toestel is reeds 'n GPU-nodus."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "Die GPU-nodus is gestoor."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "Die GPU-nodus kon nie gestoor word nie."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Die GPU-nodus is verwyder. Sy Cacti-toestel is in plek gelaat."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Die GPU-nodus is nie verwyder nie omdat GPU-rekords daaraan behoort. Deaktiveer dit eerder; GPU-rekords word nooit geskrap nie."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "Die GPU behoort nou aan die nodus waar dit gesien is, met sy geskiedenis."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "Die GPU bly by sy aangetekende nodus."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "Die GPU sal die datanavraag by die volgende herindeksering verlaat. Sy grafieke en RRD-lêers word behou."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "Slegs 'n afwesige GPU kan uit die datanavraag verwyder word."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Die skep van 'n toestel vereis toestemming om Cacti-toestelle te bestuur."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Beskrywing: voer tot 150 drukbare karakters in."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Gasheernaam: voer 'n gasheernaam of IP-adres in."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "Die GPU Node-toestelsjabloon is nie geïnstalleer nie."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Die toestel is nie behou nie: jou rekening mag nie toestelle sien wat dit skep nie. Vra 'n administrateur om dit te skep."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Die toestel kon nie verwyder word nadat toegang geweier is nie. Vra 'n administrateur om dit te verwyder."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Die toestel en sy GPU-nodus is geskep. Stel die toestel se SNMP-opstelling op sy toestelbladsy."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
msgstr "Die toestel kon nie geskep word nie; sien die Cacti-logboek."

