#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Saving adds the GPU data query to the device, with Cacti's automatic reindex turned off: the plugin reindexes after every GPU change. Configure the device's SNMP agent first; see docs/node-setup.md."
msgstr "Stoor voeg die GPU-datanavraag by die toestel, met Cacti se outomatiese herindeksering afgeskakel: die inprop herindekseer ná elke GPU-verandering. Stel eers die toestel se SNMP-agent op; sien docs/node-setup.md."

