#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "Absent GPUs"
msgstr "Afwesige GPU's"

#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "'n Afwesige GPU bly 'n indeks van die datanavraag, dus bly sy grafieke en RRD-lêers gekoppel en wys 'n gaping. Verwydering uit die datanavraag stop dit: by die volgende herindeksering lys Cacti dit nie meer nie, sy grafieke hou op bywerk en sy databronne word as wees vertoon, en sy RRD-lêers en grafieke word behou totdat jy dit skrap. Die GPU-rekord bly behoue, en die GPU keer terug na die datanavraag as dit weer gerapporteer word."

