#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Mark Absent After"
msgstr "Merk as afwesig na"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Agtereenvolgende suksesvolle insamelings wat 'n GPU moet mis voordat dit as afwesig gemerk word, van 1 tot 100. 'n Mislukte insameling, of een wat geen GPU's rapporteer nie, tel nooit nie. Afwesige GPU's behou hul rekords en geskiedenis en word nooit outomaties geskrap nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "GPU-insameling"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Verouderd na"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Sekondes nadat die nutsding 'n monster geneem het waarna sy waardes ophou om in grafieke getoon te word, van 60 tot 86400. 'n Ouer waarde word as onbekend gerapporteer, sodat 'n gestopte insameling as 'n gaping wys, nooit as 'n plat lyn nie. Die GPU-ouderdomswaarde bly tel sodat waarskuwings daarop gegrond kan word."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deïnstalleer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Behou inproptabelle by deïnstallasie"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, behou deïnstallering van die inprop sy nodus- en GPU-rekords. Ontmerk dit sodat deïnstallering dit skrap; voer dit eers uit vanaf GPU-nodusse. Cacti-toestelle, databronne, grafieke en RRD-lêers word in elk geval nooit aangeraak nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Verwyder die inprop se Cacti-objekte tydens deïnstallering"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, verwyder deïnstallering van die inprop ook die GPU-toestelsjabloon, datanavraag, datasjabloon en grafieksjablone wat dit ingevoer het, elkeen slegs waar niks buite die inprop dit gebruik nie, en die GPU-datanavraag-XML wat dit geskryf het, slegs as die lêer onveranderd is. Dit skrap nooit RRD-lêers, toestelle, grafieke of databronne nie; sjablone wat steeds daardeur gebruik word, word behou."

